    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "I added a specific type for recommend parameters augmented with the internal identifier, so we can rely on `PlainRecommendParameters` for the queries actually sent to the API.\r\n\r\nWhile not specified in the RFC, I chose here `$$id` as the name for the id key, but I'm open to anything else.",
